{"code":0,"message":"success","value":{"docId":"5871875c8f3245289bab9f7d40d98931","title":"Integrating the Wear Engine SDK","lang":"en","domain":"10100000","businessName":"HMS Core > Smart Devices","businessType":"10101014","businessTypeName":"Wear Engine","serviceType":"5734b590f11f4e839a20a8642c1a1a29","version":"V16","anchorList":[],"status":"4","content":{"content":"<html><head></head><body><a name=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000001874111094\"></a><a name=\"EN-US_TOPIC_0000001874111094\"></a>   <h1>Integrating the Wear Engine SDK</h1>   <div>    <p>For details about the DevEco Studio development environment, refer to <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/harmonyos-guides-V2/deveco_overview-0000001053582387-V2\" target=\"_blank\">DevEco Studio User Guide</a>.</p>    <ol>     <li><span>Download the SDK file to the local host and decompress the <strong>wearengine.js</strong> file.</span>      <p>      </p><ul>       <li>SDK on the lite wearable device: <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/connectivity-Library/litewearable-sdk-cn-0000001705004353\" target=\"_blank\">Wear Engine SDK (Lite Wearable Devices)</a> (<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/ru/doc/development/connectivity-Library/litewearable-sdk-0000001100540376\" target=\"_blank\">SDK на носимых устройствах версии lite</a> for Russian users)</li>       <li>SDK on the smart wearable device: <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/connectivity-Library/wearable-sdk-cn-0000001656684902\" target=\"_blank\">Wear Engine SDK (Smart Wearable Devices)</a> (<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/ru/doc/development/connectivity-Library/wearable-sdk-0000001147500149\" target=\"_blank\">SDK на умных носимых устройствах-JS</a> for Russian users)</li>      </ul>      <p></p></li>     <li><span>Copy the <strong>wearengine.js</strong> file to the code project directory <strong>\\entry\\src\\main\\js\\default</strong><strong>\\pages</strong> and import it to the code.</span>      <p>      </p><pre class=\"screen\">import { P2pClient, Message, Builder } from '../wearengine.js'</pre>      <p></p></li>    </ol>    <div class=\"note\">     <img originheight=\"38\" originwidth=\"106\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/ee/v3/AAucYPQZR1iQzzJ0Ls137A/note_3.0-en-us.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261114T161106Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=F268FB834FFD495DD9AD20C7DD0A26AC4084FE140B081AE73E48AE25F6E4011E\"><span class=\"notetitle\"> </span>     <div class=\"notebody\">      <p>When integrating the <a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/doc/connectivity-Library/litewearable-sdk-cn-0000001705004353\" target=\"_blank\">Wear Engine SDK (Lite Wearable Devices)</a> SDK for lite wearable devices, use Compile SDK version 10 in DevEco Studio.</p>     </div>    </div>   </div>   <div></div></body></html>","metadata":{}},"catalogName":"connectivity-Guides","isImport":2,"tag":"10102010","fileName":"integrating-fitnesstwatch-sdk-0000001052859174","navigationAddress":"/hmos/hms/smart-device","updatedDate":"2026-10-08 03:24:01","serviceBreadUrl":"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/en/hms/huawei-wearengine","websiteType":"1","isGray":0,"restrictedType":0,"subTitle":"Smart Devices","domainBreadName":"","searchTitle":"","keywords":"","intelligentRecommendFlag":true,"versionLabels":[],"contentLabels":[],"showBeta":0,"displayUpdateTime":"2026-10-08 05:58:30","deviceVersion":""}}